<overview>
<p>Drawing veterans from the Com Guards, recruits from the Free Worlds League, and volunteers from Protectorate worlds, the Word of Blake Militia assembled infantry formations whose quality varied but whose equipment was consistently first-rate. Towing light autocannon optimized for long-range harassment fire, these field gun crews provide economical suppressive capability at extended distances where heavier weapons would be wasted on area targets.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Squad/platoon size from TechManual. Armor kit from Tactical Operations. Intro date from official creation of ComStar Guards and Militia (ComGuards).
